[
  {
    "id": 1,
    "text": "Silence is the sleep that nourishes wisdom.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.349572",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.349572",
    "uid": "quote-000001"
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "text": "Empty vessels make the most noise; wise minds prefer silence.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.394986",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.394986",
    "uid": "quote-000008"
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "text": "A silent man is a wise man; a wise man is a silent man.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.439798",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.439798",
    "uid": "quote-000017"
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "text": "Silence is the sanctuary of prudence.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.454844",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.454844",
    "uid": "quote-000020"
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "text": "When anger rises, think of the consequences.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.497253",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.497253",
    "uid": "quote-000029"
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "text": "Growth begins when we stop filling the silence with noise and start listening to the lessons hidden beneath our discomfort.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.608246",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.608246",
    "uid": "quote-000050"
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "text": "When words fail or falter, silence speaks volumes—an unspoken testament to inner strength and resolve.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.627818",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.627818",
    "uid": "quote-000054"
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "text": "Silence teaches what words cannot: the art of patience, the value of introspection, and the beauty of simply being.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.654551",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.654551",
    "uid": "quote-000059"
  },
  {
    "id": 62,
    "text": "In the depths of silence, even the smallest spark of intention can ignite profound change.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.668613",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.668613",
    "uid": "quote-000062"
  },
  {
    "id": 66,
    "text": "Through silence, we discover that the greatest revolutions often occur within ourselves, unseen yet unstoppable.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.687811",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.687811",
    "uid": "quote-000066"
  },
  {
    "id": 70,
    "text": "Silence is both shield and sword—a means to protect oneself and cut through the noise to what truly matters.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.708465",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.708465",
    "uid": "quote-000070"
  },
  {
    "id": 74,
    "text": "There is no greater act of rebellion against chaos than cultivating peace through deliberate silence.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.733336",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.733336",
    "uid": "quote-000074"
  },
  {
    "id": 80,
    "text": "The loudest wisdom is spoken in the quiet of a disciplined mind.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.772376",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.772376",
    "uid": "quote-000080"
  },
  {
    "id": 86,
    "text": "A mind that bends to silence bends away from chaos.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 1,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.811212",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.811212",
    "uid": "quote-000086"
  },
  {
    "id": 92,
    "text": "Words unsaid in fury are victories won in wisdom.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.850570",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.850570",
    "uid": "quote-000092"
  },
  {
    "id": 100,
    "text": "True strength lies not in the shout, but in the hush that follows.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.911441",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.911441",
    "uid": "quote-000100"
  },
  {
    "id": 105,
    "text": "Wisdom wears silence as its crown, anger as its discarded robe.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.939592",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.939592",
    "uid": "quote-000105"
  },
  {
    "id": 107,
    "text": "Silence is not the absence of words, but the presence of strength.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.953649",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.953649",
    "uid": "quote-000107"
  },
  {
    "id": 110,
    "text": "Anger is loud; wisdom whispers.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.974315",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.974315",
    "uid": "quote-000110"
  },
  {
    "id": 114,
    "text": "The strongest person in the room is often the one who says nothing.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.006287",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.006287",
    "uid": "quote-000114"
  },
  {
    "id": 118,
    "text": "Your silence today protects your peace tomorrow.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 1,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.035843",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.035843",
    "uid": "quote-000118"
  },
  {
    "id": 123,
    "text": "True power is the ability to remain silent when every word begs to be spoken.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.066498",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.066498",
    "uid": "quote-000123"
  },
  {
    "id": 129,
    "text": "When you silence your rage, you hear your wisdom.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.122664",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.122664",
    "uid": "quote-000129"
  },
  {
    "id": 135,
    "text": "To be still in the storm is to know your own strength.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.182645",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.182645",
    "uid": "quote-000135"
  },
  {
    "id": 138,
    "text": "Sometimes silence is louder than justice shouted in anger.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.212320",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.212320",
    "uid": "quote-000138"
  },
  {
    "id": 143,
    "text": "Let your silence be a statement of purpose, not surrender.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.257599",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.257599",
    "uid": "quote-000143"
  },
  {
    "id": 147,
    "text": "Silence is not emptiness; it is the space where wisdom speaks the loudest.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.293467",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.293467",
    "uid": "quote-000147"
  },
  {
    "id": 151,
    "text": "Silence is the sword of the wise; it cuts through noise and reveals truth.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.331933",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.331933",
    "uid": "quote-000151"
  },
  {
    "id": 155,
    "text": "Silence is the language of the strong; noise is the refuge of the insecure.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.373877",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.373877",
    "uid": "quote-000155"
  },
  {
    "id": 159,
    "text": "Silence is the armor against foolishness; wear it wisely.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.412126",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.412126",
    "uid": "quote-000159"
  },
  {
    "id": 163,
    "text": "Silence is the canvas, and wisdom is the art painted upon it.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.450465",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.450465",
    "uid": "quote-000163"
  },
  {
    "id": 167,
    "text": "Silence is the refuge of the thoughtful; noise is the playground of the distracted.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.491960",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.491960",
    "uid": "quote-000167"
  },
  {
    "id": 171,
    "text": "خاموشی عقلمند کی تلوار ہے، جو بے جا باتوں کو کاٹ دیتی ہے۔",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.531331",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.531331",
    "uid": "quote-000171"
  },
  {
    "id": 175,
    "text": "خاموشی سب سے بڑا جواب ہے۔",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Wisdom",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.573846",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.573846",
    "uid": "quote-000175"
  }
]
